   Pinned commit e52bbc981ac8f78264aa41ae52b6a195b705cd40 (2 May 2026).
   Adapted, not vendored: no FinKit file is copied verbatim. Component structure
   from `HeroBalanceCard.tsx`, `TransactionRow.tsx` and
   `TransactionDetailDrawer.tsx` was rewritten into MOVY conventions, MOVY design
   tokens, and MOVY's integer-cents money module. Every adapted file carries a
   header naming its origin path and pinned commit. FinKit's `FinKitProvider`,
   `theme.css`, `formatters.ts` and `Progress.tsx` were not used at all.

